  "body": "After 20 happy years, it's time for a new chapter. Much loved and enjoyed by its current owner, this welcoming Stanmore Bay home is now ready for someone new to move in, make memories and add their own personal touch.\r\n\r\nTucked away down a shared driveway, this three-bedroom home offers a wonderful sense of privacy, with a lovely garden setting and easy indoor-outdoor living. Whether you're starting out, raising a young family or simply looking for a place to call your own, there's plenty here to appreciate.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is comfortable, tidy and practical. Three generously sized bedrooms provide plenty of space, while the open-plan lounge and dining area creates a relaxed setting for everyday living. A separate galley-style kitchen offers everything you need, while a separate laundry, good storage and heat pumps add to the home's practicality.\r\n\r\nStep outside and you'll discover one of this property's real highlights. A covered deck provides the perfect spot for summer barbecues, morning coffees or entertaining friends, overlooking a private garden and lawn where children and pets can play. It's an outdoor space that's easy to enjoy and offers room to make it your own.\r\n\r\nWith a floor area of approximately 84sqm (more or less), a cross-lease title with a half share of 1,401sqm, a carport and additional off-street parking, this property offers a great combination of comfort, outdoor space and potential.\r\n\r\nWhile perfectly comfortable as it is, the home also presents an exciting opportunity for those with an eye for improvement. Refresh the interiors, update over time and create something that truly reflects your own style.\r\n\r\nAfter two decades of being a much-loved home, the owner is moving to a retirement village, and the time has come to pass it on to someone new.\r\n\r\nHomes with heart, privacy and potential are always worth a look. Come and see what your next chapter could look like here.",
